WEBVTT

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:03.155
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Lisa has lunch at one o’clock.

00:00:07.244 --> 00:00:10.091
She finishes work at six o’clock.

00:00:14.096 --> 00:00:15.542
She goes to the gym.

00:00:19.539 --> 00:00:21.200
She watches TV.

00:00:25.268 --> 00:00:26.555
She goes shopping.

00:00:30.645 --> 00:00:32.085
She goes to work.

00:00:36.153 --> 00:00:37.640
She does housework.

00:00:41.731 --> 00:00:44.260
She gets up at quarter to seven.

00:00:48.312 --> 00:00:51.198
She goes to bed at half past eleven.

00:00:55.276 --> 00:00:56.501
She makes dinner.

00:01:00.579 --> 00:01:01.757
She has a coffee.

00:01:05.796 --> 00:01:08.493
She has dinner at half past eight.